    "answer": {
      "short": "4 years",
      "worked": "$$4520=18820(0.7)^n$$\nUse trial and error:\n$$\\begin{align*}S(3.9)&=18820(0.7)^{3.9}\\approx\\$4682.76\\\\S(4)&=18820(0.7)^4=\\$4518.68\\end{align*}$$\nThe target is reached just before 4 years, so the time is 4 years to the nearest year.",
